    "reading": "Held-out lift 9.61x over random at 20 counts/month (bar 2.2x); ceiling hit-rate 0.2317. The signal is the ledger failing to reconcile with its own transactions: a plain tier-1 rule reaches 0.1983 vs the scorer's 0.2275, and dropping tier-1 features leaves 0.225 because burn-rate inconsistency sees the same event. This generator's errors are mostly one-day spikes that break arithmetic; only 8% of wrong reports are silent (no tier-1 flag), and those are recalled at 83%. Real ledgers with internally consistent phantom stock will be harder: treat these numbers as an upper bound on this generator, not a forecast of field performance.",
